Subject: [PATCH 3/4] =?UTF-8?q?Meridian:=20a=20space's=20AI=20account=20ca?=
 =?UTF-8?q?n=20be=20picked=20in=20Settings=20=E2=80=BA=20AI,=20and=20~/.cl?=
